#: ../../source/getting_started/quick_start.rst:2 c26e128919224c049328e869fce82a9b
msgid "快速开始"
msgstr "Quick start"

#: ../../source/getting_started/quick_start.rst:4 8db74569fbf34ddea17c33073d50cdfd
msgid "安装完成后，将音频导入为 ``FmodAudioStream``，赋给播放器节点即可播放。安装步骤见 :doc:`installation`。"
msgstr ""
"After installation, import audio as ``FmodAudioStream`` and assign it to a player node. See "
":doc:`installation` for setup."

#: ../../source/getting_started/quick_start.rst:7 60548a5a9f464fe39ed7ccf3142d9a80
msgid "导入音频"
msgstr "Import audio"

#: ../../source/getting_started/quick_start.rst:9 bf63b971f999422082aae125238b48b0
msgid "将音频文件放入项目，在文件系统面板选中它。"
msgstr "Add an audio file to the project and select it in the FileSystem dock."

#: ../../source/getting_started/quick_start.rst:10 977552baa1794aa7830e4470973858bc
msgid "在导入面板将 **导入为** 改为 **FMOD Audio**。"
msgstr "Set **Import As** to **FMOD Audio** in the Import dock."

#: ../../source/getting_started/quick_start.rst:11 0eae05b0f6a246ddb84bc60d46f5bd40
msgid "音乐选择 **Stream (Low memory)**；短音效选择 **Sample (High quality)**；循环短音效选择 **Loop Sample**。"
msgstr ""
"Choose **Stream (Low memory)** for music, **Sample (High quality)** for short effects, or **Loop "
"Sample** for looping short effects."

#: ../../source/getting_started/quick_start.rst:12 17f0a652573a409d938fe514c41458ee
msgid "点击 **重新导入**。"
msgstr "Click **Reimport**."

#: ../../source/getting_started/quick_start.rst:15 9fedb5320a4f4a5cb99033772f312a5e
msgid "创建播放器"
msgstr "Create a player"

#: ../../source/getting_started/quick_start.rst:17 a67466e00baa4327995ed368cae06a62
msgid "新建场景，以 ``Node`` 为根节点，添加 ``FmodAudioStreamPlayer`` 子节点。"
msgstr "Create a scene with a ``Node`` root and a ``FmodAudioStreamPlayer`` child."

#: ../../source/getting_started/quick_start.rst:18 b252a9f5fa804357b1f1e407740fd143
msgid "将导入后的音频拖到播放器的 **Stream** 属性，**Bus** 保持 ``Master``。"
msgstr "Drag the imported audio onto the player **Stream** property and keep **Bus** set to ``Master``."

#: ../../source/getting_started/quick_start.rst:19 2addf15fa7134912a4575e14ce17cc23
msgid "展开 Stream 资源，使用波形下方的播放按钮试听；点击波形可跳转。"
msgstr "Expand the Stream resource and use its playback button to audition it. Click the waveform to seek."

#: ../../source/getting_started/quick_start.rst:20 45eeef6bc6eb45d7a01459e7d4290df8
msgid "启用播放器的 **Auto Play**，按 F6 运行当前场景。"
msgstr "Enable **Auto Play** and press F6 to run the current scene."

#: ../../source/getting_started/quick_start.rst:22 3614a20661d74d77855d8f4f1397ffd6
msgid ""
"``FmodAudioStreamPlayer2D`` 和 ``FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D`` 分别用于 2D 和 3D 位置音频，见 "
":doc:`../user_guide/playback`。"
msgstr ""
"Use ``FmodAudioStreamPlayer2D`` and ``FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D`` for positional audio in 2D and "
"3D; see :doc:`../user_guide/playback`."

#: ../../source/getting_started/quick_start.rst:25 50ff61b6ac5b4582bfe78a30ac33bf79
msgid "用脚本控制"
msgstr "Control playback with a script"

#: ../../source/getting_started/quick_start.rst:27 a8ef612ae18d4dbea74bc12eeef78b6c
msgid "将以下脚本挂到根节点，保留已设置的 Stream，关闭 Auto Play："
msgstr "Attach this script to the root, keep the assigned Stream, and disable Auto Play:"

#: ../../source/getting_started/quick_start.rst:29 7a57b003c1ab40f08f56b279f02d2a84
msgid ""
"extends Node\n"
"\n"
"@onready var player: FmodAudioStreamPlayer = $FmodAudioStreamPlayer\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"func _ready() -> void:\n"
"    player.play()\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"func _unhandled_input(event: InputEvent) -> void:\n"
"    if event.is_action_pressed(&\"ui_accept\"):\n"
"        player.stream_paused = not player.stream_paused\n"
"    elif event.is_action_pressed(&\"ui_cancel\"):\n"
"        player.stop()\n"
"    elif event.is_action_pressed(&\"ui_up\"):\n"
"        player.volume_db = minf(player.volume_db + 3.0, 0.0)\n"
"    elif event.is_action_pressed(&\"ui_down\"):\n"
"        player.volume_db = maxf(player.volume_db - 3.0, -60.0)"
msgstr ""
"extends Node\n"
"\n"
"@onready var player: FmodAudioStreamPlayer = $FmodAudioStreamPlayer\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"func _ready() -> void:\n"
"    player.play()\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"func _unhandled_input(event: InputEvent) -> void:\n"
"    if event.is_action_pressed(&\"ui_accept\"):\n"
"        player.stream_paused = not player.stream_paused\n"
"    elif event.is_action_pressed(&\"ui_cancel\"):\n"
"        player.stop()\n"
"    elif event.is_action_pressed(&\"ui_up\"):\n"
"        player.volume_db = minf(player.volume_db + 3.0, 0.0)\n"
"    elif event.is_action_pressed(&\"ui_down\"):\n"
"        player.volume_db = maxf(player.volume_db - 3.0, -60.0)"

#: ../../source/getting_started/quick_start.rst:50 8eaa97120e8f4fa6bfe2128709ed2831
msgid "Enter 或空格切换暂停，Esc 停止，上下方向键调整音量。再次播放调用 ``play()``。暂停保留位置，停止后再播放从头开始。"
msgstr ""
"Enter or Space toggles pause, Esc stops playback, and Up/Down adjusts volume. Call ``play()`` to "
"start again. Pausing keeps the position; playing after a stop starts from the beginning."

