msgstr "Destination bus name; defaults to ``Master``"

#: ../../source/getting_started/quick_start.rst:69 b48a73c400a542518cfadda667074502
msgid "试听与总线面板"
msgstr "Audition and bus meters"

#: ../../source/getting_started/quick_start.rst:71 6e434fcffe084b8b9d5699dead80a963
msgid ""
"项目默认同步 Godot 音频总线。同步开启时，在原生 Audio 面板管理总线；FMOD Audio 面板显示同步提示。需要独立布局与编辑器内 FMOD 电平时，关闭 "
"``audio/fmod/sync_godot_audio_buses`` 并重新加载项目，详见 :doc:`../user_guide/mixer`。"
msgstr ""
"Projects synchronize Godot audio buses by default. Edit buses in the native Audio panel while "
"synchronization is enabled; FMOD Audio shows a synchronization hint. For independent layouts and "
"editor FMOD meters, disable ``audio/fmod/sync_godot_audio_buses`` and reload the project. See "
":doc:`../user_guide/mixer`."

